---
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="About" description="About River and River's Edge.">
	<h1>About</h1>
	<p>
		I'm River, a software engineer. I work at <a href="https://arcade.dev">Arcade</a>, and I'm an
		openly queer, trans engineer.
	</p>
	<p>
		River's Edge is where I write up what I've done in the tech industry: war stories, postmortems,
		and the lessons that stuck. Now and then I'll write about life in tech as a queer, trans person,
		too.
	</p>
	<p>You can find me on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>.</p>
</Page>
